# Confirmation Rate

## Problem Summary

Write a query to calculate the confirmation rate for each user, rounded to 2 decimal places. Users with no confirmation records should also be included.

## Solution

```sql
select s.user_id,
round(
    avg(
        case
            when c.action = 'confirmed' then 1
            else 0
        end
    ), 2
) as confirmation_rate
from signups s left join confirmations c
on s.user_id = c.user_id group by s.user_id;
```
